---
description: TypeScript rules (strict typing, interfaces, no loose types)
globs: apps/**/src/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

# TypeScript

- Enable and respect strict mode (already on). No `any`/`unknown`
- Type function params and returns explicitly for exported APIs/components
- Prefer `interface`/type aliases for structured data models
- Avoid default parameter values; require explicit arguments
- Derive types from sources when possible (e.g., `as const` objects → mapped types)
- Never cast to force types; refactor to make types align
